Third-party terms
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ensemble integrates with third-party services and models through adapters. The
framework itself bundles none of them, but instances that wire these adapters
are bound by the corresponding terms:

- Model providers (e.g. Anthropic Claude): subject to the provider's usage
  terms and acceptable-use policy. Model outputs are not covered by this
  program's AGPL license.
- Vision / audio-representation models used by instances (e.g. MERT, CLAP):
  subject to their respective licenses; see the instance's NOTICE.
- Fonts, corpora, and reference material used by an instance are governed by the
  instance's own NOTICE, not this file.

Instances built on ensemble MUST carry their own NOTICE enumerating the specific
model, font, and data terms they invoke.
